H2: Why Brokers Start With MT5
Ask a room of active forex traders which platform they use, and a large share will say MetaTrader. That familiarity is valuable. A new client who already knows the MT5 trading platform doesn't need to learn anything to start trading with you, and that removes one more reason to hesitate before funding an account.
